  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『GUNDAM FACTORY YOKOHAMA』の動く実物大ガンダムのオリジナル商品。チタニウムフィニッシュを施した特別仕様で登場！",
      "en": "An original moving life-sized Gundam product from \"GUNDAM FACTORY YOKOHAMA\". Introducing a special specification with titanium finish!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• チタニウムフィニッシュ加工を施した高級感溢れる仕上がり",
      "en": "• Luxury finish with titanium finish processing"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 歩行、右腕上げ、両腕あげなど動くガンダムの挙動を再現できる可動域！",
      "en": "• Range of motion that allows you to reproduce Gundam's movements such as walking, raising the right arm, raising both arms, etc.!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 動くガンダム「RX-78F00」のディティール、カラーリングを徹底再現",
      "en": "• Thorough reproduction of the details and coloring of the moving Gundam \"RX-78F00\""
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ライフル、シールドが付属",
      "en": "• Rifle and Seal included"
    }
  ],
